Its packages keep their own licenses: alpine-baselayout, alpine-baselayout-data,
apk-tools, busybox, busybox-binsh, libapk, scanelf and ssl_client (GPL-2.0-only);
musl-utils (MIT AND BSD-2-Clause AND GPL-2.0-or-later); ca-certificates-bundle
(MPL-2.0 AND MIT); zlib (Zlib); libcrypto3 and libssl3 (Apache-2.0); musl,
alpine-keys and alpine-release (MIT). Sources:
https://gitlab.alpinelinux.org/alpine/aports/-/tree/3.24-stable
